The double mapping of executable memory on witos (plan step N3.2): 8.0 sizes its shared memory file
at 2 TB, past the 16 GiB the libc gives a shared memory file; upstream's later change, which 10.0 holds, sizes it to
the physical memory and the address space and file size limits, backported unchanged.

--- a/src/coreclr/minipal/Unix/doublemapping.cpp
